    "question": "Who can get help under Vahan Aksmat Sahay?",
    "answer": "Victims of road‑traffic accidents are eligible for assistance under the **Vahan Aksmat Sahay** Scheme. To receive help, a person must:\n\n- Be a victim of a road‑traffic accident,  \n- Require immediate medical treatment for the injuries,  \n- Obtain treatment at a hospital empanelled under the scheme,  \n- Have a Medico‑Legal Case registered for the accident, and  \n- Have police intimation with acknowledgment for the accident.  \n\n(Source: **Vahan Aksmat Sahay** – eligibility section)",
